        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I moved to Dorian about a year ago. Got to be the biggest mistake I've ever made. This city is so unorganized so unprepared it's a joke. I can't wait to find another place to move. It's got to be the worst city I ever lived in",
        "time": 1755273508,
        "translated": false
